1
00:00:00,702 --> 00:00:04,392
4:40. The school just moved Mia's pickup to 5:15.

2
00:00:05,244 --> 00:00:06,817
Alex's train is late.

3
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:11,285
One change. The whole evening comes apart.

4
00:00:13,936 --> 00:00:17,404
Relay Home rebuilds the evening. And it asks before it acts.

5
00:00:20,005 --> 00:00:21,038
Say what changed.

6
00:00:21,985 --> 00:00:26,280
Who can collect Mia. What dinner fits. One plan.

7
00:00:28,519 --> 00:00:32,425
Every step: a real MCP call.

8
00:00:35,716 --> 00:00:37,283
Four adults. One deadline.

9
00:00:37,882 --> 00:00:43,079
Not on the school list: never suggested.

10
00:00:46,174 --> 00:00:52,450
Nothing happens without your yes.

11
00:00:53,881 --> 00:00:57,808
Asked. Not covered until Jo answers.

12
00:00:57,969 --> 00:01:02,102
A private link, for this request only.

13
00:01:05,185 --> 00:01:06,879
Jo's phone. One question.

14
00:01:12,934 --> 00:01:16,644
Confirmed, from Jo's own phone.

15
00:01:18,808 --> 00:01:23,170
The exact total. Nothing more.

16
00:01:24,578 --> 00:01:26,662
Once. Inside the weekly cap.

17
00:01:28,084 --> 00:01:30,128
Jo cannot make it.

18
00:01:32,207 --> 00:01:37,956
It stops. It names no one.

19
00:01:39,082 --> 00:01:40,691
The yes, on the wire.

20
00:01:40,989 --> 00:01:44,837
The server asks. The answer is sealed to the question.

21
00:01:45,136 --> 00:01:47,565
Jo's phone answers the server itself.

22
00:01:49,467 --> 00:01:52,790
12 tools. 2 protocol revisions. 34 tests.

23
00:01:53,090 --> 00:01:56,094
The same server, from a Strands agent.

24
00:01:58,696 --> 00:02:00,969
Relay Home. It asks before it acts.
